        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Sequence Diagram - Process Medicine Sale\n\nactor Customer\nactor Cashier\nparticipant \&quot;Pharmacy Management System\&quot; as System\ndatabase Database\n\n== Purchase Request ==\n\nCustomer -&gt; Cashier : Request to purchase medicines\nactivate Cashier\n\nCashier -&gt; System : Enter medicine and quantity\ndeactivate Cashier\n\nactivate System\n\nSystem -&gt; Database : Check medicine availability\nactivate Database\nDatabase --&gt; System : Return stock details\ndeactivate Database\n\nalt Medicine available\n\n    System -&gt; System : Calculate total amount\n\n    System -&gt; Database : Record sale\n    activate Database\n    Database --&gt; System : Sale saved\n    deactivate Database\n\n    System -&gt; Database : Update inventory\n    activate Database\n    Database --&gt; System : Inventory updated\n    deactivate Database\n\n    System -&gt; Cashier : Display bill details\n    deactivate System\n\n    activate Cashier\n    Cashier -&gt; Customer : Provide bill\n    deactivate Cashier\n\nelse Insufficient stock\n\n    System -&gt; Cashier : Display \&quot;Out of Stock\&quot;\n    deactivate System\n\n    activate Cashier\n    Cashier -&gt; Customer : Inform medicine unavailable\n    deactivate Cashier\n\nend\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="6lcXH_PQ3WYB8GReBgUp-235">
